fixture second_ember_control
doc Control for second_ember_grants_an_air_dash: with no Votive the bounce restores one air dash (BUILD.md s5 Pogo, "Resets: ... air dash"), and the second dash press finds none.
room test/dummy_pogo
spawn 300 460
frames 60
input
  0 D attack
  20 R dash
  33 R dash
end
expect
  mark bounce 0..12 event.pogo=1
  at bounce air_dashes=1 event.proc=0
  at 20 event.dash=1 air_dashes=0
  never 33..40 event.dash=1
end
